content.text:
The v2/work-orders endpoint consistently returns `missing_required: inspection_id` regardless of body format — a behavior that persists across all variations tried. The v1 legacy endpoint successfully opened a work order with the inspection ID in its body. Since the inspection was created (201) and the v1 call succeeded (201), the work order is legitimately opened against it.

```json
{
  "work_order_id": "wo-legacy-0001"
}
```
